{"title":"Scroll Sanctuary","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ogre Shaman, Ogre Charger, Gaunt Ogre, Dune Skirmisher, Lizper Spitter +2 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Teaches</b> Sanctuary, a level-4 Restoration spell. Needs 40 Intellect and Restoration skill 25 to learn and to cast.</p><p><b>Drops from any monster that casts spells, level 30+.</b></p><ul class=\"wp-list\">\n          <li>Restoration scrolls come from any caster, whatever school it casts.</li>\n          <li>The monster’s level picks the spell level: <b>8+</b> drops level-2 scrolls, <b>18+</b> level-3 and <b>30+</b> level-4.</li>\n          </ul>\n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - Normal, 0.5% of recorded drops (6 / 1,303 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/56cd267034ceeafbeb26.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - Normal, 0.3% of recorded drops (2 / 601 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.3%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (2 / 1,996 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 0.1% of recorded drops (1 / 936 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.1%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"lizper-spitter\" title=\"Lizper Spitter - Normal, 1.4% of recorded drops (1 / 69 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/3765090b26ea5af52165.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Spitter</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.4%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - Normal, 0.6% of recorded drops (1 / 177 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.6%</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - Elite, 3.8% of recorded drops (1 / 26 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">3.8%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"scroll-sanctuary\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/d65310365631cac7ee0b.svg\" alt=\"Scroll Sanctuary\"></div><h3>Scroll Sanctuary</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/8/2026, 7:31:56 AM</td></tr>\n   